% Defines a module inline in a .thm, shows it, imports it, and shows
% the resulting instance. Also shows a module loaded from a .thmod file.

Module Counter.
  Kind counter type.
  Type zero counter.
  Type succ counter -> counter.
  Type positive counter -> prop.
  Axiom one_pos : positive (succ zero).
End Counter.

Show Module Counter.

Import Module C = Counter.
Show Module C.

Type one C.counter.

Show Module "List".
